      median required M_P(<R500)/M_fw(<R500) = 0.806; median required |slip| at R500 = 1.570e-05 (= 0.31 x the framework's own lensing potential)
      ---- alt footing
      cluster   slope fw  slope WL  M_P(<R500)/M_fw  |slip| at R500  |s|/2|Phi_L|
      A85         -0.258    -0.838            0.539       4.509e-06          0.11
